{"id": "1540946695322341386", "channel_id": "1538395366620135474", "author_id": "293051171663249418", "author_name": "fon_tain", "content": "配置太高了就拿困難試試，應該是可以過啦，增殖刻在肉脂，拿到鯨魚覺醒之後極夜拿覺醒0費然後拿肉脂上侵蝕秒了，沙爺磚是為了算力有刻意少買造物所以黑印屬性影響應該不大", "timestamp": "2026-08-23T04:52:01.570000+00:00", "thread_id": "1538395366620135474", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-23T04:54:25.883000+00:00", "reactions": [{"emoji": "🛐", "emoji_id": null, "count": 1}], "attachments": [{"id": "1540946695049842698", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/webp", "size": 318098, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1538395366620135474/1540946695049842698/image.png?ex=6a8bcdf1&is=6a8a7c71&hm=ebc847cec29df4b4aea0b3f34b8b95dbf84ca423601f9cb8cb273af77e52d6cd&"}], "thread_title": "忘卻8—12要怎過？", "forum_channel_id": "1356200054276493444"}
