{"id": "1541004614776659988", "channel_id": "1541004614776659988", "author_id": "832854872398233682", "author_name": "blueishpoop2447", "content": "大家好，目前遊玩18天，守密人41級，主線到7-9，想請教大家抽卡方面的建議。\n\n茉夏用了70抽才出，目前E0；之後又抽了30次，歪到重複的諾締拉。若繼續抽茉夏池，最多60抽可以再取得一隻。另外有362個純粹核心。\n\n目前有32,651銀幣，按十抽1,980銀幣估算，約可抽164次；加上4個抽卡核心，合計約168抽。其他資源放在截圖中。\n\n茉夏精選池還有14天，晦夜引燈還有13天。目前考慮在晦夜引燈選擇 泰旖絲、奧爾拉、萊克、彌利亞姆，先抽到其中一名，再回去補茉夏。請問這樣分配是否合理？各池建議抽到甚麼程度停手？如果有其他更合適的抽卡或養成建議，也麻煩大家指教，謝謝！", "timestamp": "2026-08-23T08:42:10.644000+00:00", "thread_id": "1541004614776659988", "attachments": [{"id": "1541004615653261382", "filename": "Screenshot_20260823_162951.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 2363912, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1541004614776659988/1541004615653261382/Screenshot_20260823_162951.png?ex=6a8c03e2&is=6a8ab262&hm=68e0f0b5bdf26df204904e4695115a5f439fe66de62722b9a4c98e8fadcb6b7f&"}, {"id": "1541004616139935804", "filename": "Screenshot_20260823_163114.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1248457, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1541004614776659988/1541004616139935804/Screenshot_20260823_163114.png?ex=6a8c03e2&is=6a8ab262&hm=5f7830101627d2e2ddceb120f3982e1bbadcbe89d438b718404514d9824233c6&"}, {"id": "1541004616723079218", "filename": "Screenshot_20260823_163201.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 114599, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1541004614776659988/1541004616723079218/Screenshot_20260823_163201.png?ex=6a8c03e3&is=6a8ab263&hm=4cba5a3f781d642f81e4c54fcafa44d98fd04b023f1add9bf9a11371aebb7cc1&"}], "thread_title": "入坑半個月求抽卡建議", "forum_channel_id": "1356200054276493444", "is_thread_starter": true}
